                                "id": "0,10,0,0",
                                "type": 4,
                                "level": 1,
                                "elements": "The variable u is declared before the loop and equals 0. The assignment u=u+i accumulates the sum: at the first iteration the right side reads the outer variable u, in the following iterations — the accumulated value.",
